OL,3,ALula says rival should be disqualified
OL,4,Aover alleged Meta interference ahead of
OL,5,ABrazil vote
OL,6,
OL,7,FBrazilian President Luiz Inacio Lula da
OL,8,FSilva's campaign has requested the
OL,9,Fdisqualification of right-wing
OL,10,Fchallenger Flavio Bolsonaro in the lead
OL,11,Fup to the final round of the
OL,12,Fpresidential election on Sunday over
OL,13,Falleged interference by social media
OL,14,Fcompany Meta.
OL,16,FIn a petition filed to the country's
OL,17,Ftop electoral court on Wednesday, the
OL,18,Fleftist incumbent president accused
OL,19,FMeta, the tech giant behind Whatsapp,
OL,20,FInstagram and Facebook, of limiting its
OL,21,Fcontent to boost Bolsonaro's campaign.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
