OL,3,ALula says rival should be disqualified
OL,4,Aover alleged Meta interference ahead of
OL,5,ABrazil vote
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn response, Bolsonaro filed a petition
OL,8,Fseeking to disqualify Lula over what he
OL,9,Fsaid was the mass dissemination of
OL,10,Fgovernment posts on WhatsApp.
OL,12,FThe company has denied the campaigns
OL,13,Fhave been treated unequally.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
